  "details": "Avatar shop filtering UI flow has regressed and broken, it now also breaks the UI when used.\n\n1. Open Quick Menu.\n\n2. Navigate to Avatars.\n\n3. Click Shop on the left side to navigate there. You should now be in the Shop's \"Avatars\" tab.\n\n4. Click the Filters icon.\n\n5. Click the Search in Filters. Nothing happens. Clicking the \"X\" also does nothing.\n\n6. Press Escape.\n\n7. Open Quick Menu and Avatars. Notice the UI may be broken.\n\nExpected behavior: A text box pop-up to input a search term for filtering, functional filtering.\n\nActual behavior: See the video. Unresponsive UI, no search textbox pop-up, the filters UI stays permanently attached/shown in the menu.\n\nN.B.: This also happens live/online, not only in the error world. (I just ended up in the error world by accident due to a closed instance, and thought it was appropriate for a video recording.)\n\nReported-by: AndonKavic",
